{"3887140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GreenGrass", "steam_appid": 3887140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887140/extras/c4c7dc88342122dcc729cce77bc6b606.avif?t=1779722044\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887140/extras_big/c4c7dc88342122dcc729cce77bc6b606.avif?t=1779722044 width=800 height=407 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GreenGrass is a 10–30 minute VR experience where you walk through a moody, stylized forest across three distinct days. Designed for performance and built in Unreal Engine, it combines the warm simplicity of sixth-gen console visuals with the presence only VR can offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive under cover of night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the second day, the forest opens into something brighter, more atmospheric—almost dreamlike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By evening, you retreat to a tent and settle in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s no HUD, no objective markers, no distractions. Just you and the woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Play in VR or 2D</strong> – Supports Meta PC VR and SteamVR headsets, as well as traditional flat-screen mode with gamepad or mouse/keyboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌲 <strong>Three Narrative Days</strong> – Each part of the forest has a different feel, time, and emotional tone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎙️ <strong>Narrated Experience</strong> – A voice guides you through the woods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Stylized Aesthetic</strong> – Designed like a sixth-gen game brought into VR: textured, colorful, and evocative—not low-poly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧭 <strong>Minimal HUD</strong> – Just the essentials: subtle prompts for grabbable items, nothing more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕰️ <strong>Compact Length</strong> – Experience the full story in just 10–30 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💷 <strong>Priced Like a Coffee</strong> – £4 for a tightly focused, atmospheric escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👣 <strong>No Combat, Just Presence</strong> – Explore at your pace. </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887140/extras/c4c7dc88342122dcc729cce77bc6b606.avif?t=1779722044\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887140/extras_big/c4c7dc88342122dcc729cce77bc6b606.avif?t=1779722044 width=800 height=407 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GreenGrass is a 10–30 minute VR experience where you walk through a moody, stylized forest across three distinct days. Designed for performance and built in Unreal Engine, it combines the warm simplicity of sixth-gen console visuals with the presence only VR can offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive under cover of night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the second day, the forest opens into something brighter, more atmospheric—almost dreamlike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By evening, you retreat to a tent and settle in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s no HUD, no objective markers, no distractions. Just you and the woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Play in VR or 2D</strong> – Supports Meta PC VR and SteamVR headsets, as well as traditional flat-screen mode with gamepad or mouse/keyboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌲 <strong>Three Narrative Days</strong> – Each part of the forest has a different feel, time, and emotional tone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎙️ <strong>Narrated Experience</strong> – A voice guides you through the woods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Stylized Aesthetic</strong> – Designed like a sixth-gen game brought into VR: textured, colorful, and evocative—not low-poly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧭 <strong>Minimal HUD</strong> – Just the essentials: subtle prompts for grabbable items, nothing more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕰️ <strong>Compact Length</strong> – Experience the full story in just 10–30 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💷 <strong>Priced Like a Coffee</strong> – £4 for a tightly focused, atmospheric escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👣 <strong>No Combat, Just Presence</strong> – Explore at your pace. </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A short, immersive VR experience inspired by sixth-generation console aesthetics. Explore a stylized forest over three surreal days. Walk, watch, and rest. Built for performance and atmosphere, GreenGrass is a compact journey with a long echo.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887140/44abef3feef88f17045132008fe39f8430c847e7/header.jpg?t=1779722044", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887140/ad497a9014093d197b8992bb5c658c0f9841686e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779722044", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887140/ad497a9014093d197b8992bb5c658c0f9841686e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779722044", "website": "https://www.spring86.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1070 / GeForce RTX 4050 / AMD Radeon RX Vega 56<br></li